 130: `--smp`/`--mem` flag defaults are hardcoded in `main.go` but kept in sync
 131: by hand, and remain overridable per-run regardless.
 132: 
 133: ## Networking (and why there IS a default route now)
 134: 
 135: The appliance has **two NICs**, same as the reference VM:
