 171: # Sanity: both binaries should be linux/amd64 ELF, since they're going onto
 172: # an x86-64 Linux server (same check fetch-vpcs.sh already does for vpcs at
 173: # build time; repeated here since --supervisor-bin/--vpcs-bin let a caller
